VRClip is a fork of Seal (https://github.com/JunkFood02/Seal) by JunkFood02 and
contributors, licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. This fork adds:

  - Meta Quest (2, 3, 3S, Pro) support, including a fully immersive Meta Spatial
    SDK video player.
  - An in-app 3D/360/180/stereoscopic video player for Android, with a custom
    OpenGL equirectangular/stereo renderer.
  - 2D to 3D conversion on the device, live in the player and as a file export.
  - A full Material 3 Expressive redesign of the user interface.

