  - yt-dlp (https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp): Unlicense
  - FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org/): LGPL/GPL, as built by the youtubedl-android
    project
  - aria2 (https://aria2.github.io/): GPL-2.0-or-later
  - youtubedl-android (https://github.com/JunkFood02/youtubedl-android): GPLv3,
    providing the Android bindings for the above
  - AndroidX Media3 / ExoPlayer (https://github.com/androidx/media3): Apache-2.0
  - Meta Spatial SDK (https://developers.meta.com/horizon/develop/spatial-sdk):
